# Celestial axes swapped (CTYPE1 = DEC, CTYPE2 = RA) in PC + CDELT form
# with unequal CDELT and an off-diagonal PC (synthetic). Unlike
# axes_swapped (CD form), this pins that CDELTi is indexed by WORLD axis
# i, not by the pixel axis that feeds it.
# NOTE on pixel order: as in axes_swapped.
NOTE pipeline: swapped celestial axes, PC + unequal CDELT
GRID 1 512 9 1 512 9
PIX 256.5 256.5
HEADER
NAXIS   = 2
NAXIS1  = 512
NAXIS2  = 512
CTYPE1  = 'DEC--TAN'
CTYPE2  = 'RA---TAN'
CRVAL1  = 30.0
CRVAL2  = 180.0
CRPIX1  = 256.5
CRPIX2  = 200.5
CDELT1  = 0.0009
CDELT2  = -0.0012
PC1_2   = 0.2
PC2_1   = -0.1
